      "instructions": "Concat is a video editor; these tools edit its projects. A project is a folder: open one (project_open) or make one (project_create), then pass its folder as `path` to every other tool. Read timeline_read for the ids of lanes (tracks), clips and media. Times and durations are seconds on the timeline; positions within a clip (keyframes) are fractions from 0 to 1; sizes and offsets of titles and pictures are fractions of the frame. Every edit is one undoable step (edit_undo); edit_apply with a batch command makes several into one. Edits live in memory until project_save. To render, export_start then export_wait. preview_frame shows the frame at a time. A refused edit says why in the window's words and changes nothing.",
